# Copy to .env and fill in. Nothing here is a real credential.

# Consola's E2B API key (e2b.dev → Dashboard → API Keys). It lets the contract test run against
# real E2B sandboxes. Left empty, the E2B run is skipped and only the fake provider is tested,
# as in CI. Each run starts real sandboxes on Consola's account.
E2B_API_KEY=
